Phase 14 — Performance Optimization

Objective

Optimize the complete pipeline only after functionality works.

Do not sacrifice correctness for benchmark numbers.

Target Architecture

Screen
 ↓
~3 FPS analysis
 ↓
cheap frame difference
 ↓
meaningful change?
 ↓
stabilization
 ↓
OCR only when needed
 ↓
grouping
 ↓
cache
 ↓
Qwen only for uncached text
 ↓
overlay

Optimize

Capture

Avoid unnecessary high-frequency full-resolution processing.

Change Detection

Use downscaled grayscale images.

OCR

Never OCR every frame unless explicitly configured for debugging.

Translation

Never translate identical text repeatedly.

Overlay

Update only changed regions.

GUI

Never block the Qt main thread.

Instrumentation

Add local timing metrics:

* capture time
* change detection time
* stabilization time
* OCR time
* cache lookup time
* LLM latency
* overlay update time
* end-to-end latency

Do not send metrics anywhere.

Logging

Use configurable local logging.

Avoid logging:

* screenshots
* API keys
* sensitive presentation content by default

Tests

Ensure optimization does not break existing tests.

Perform a basic live benchmark if possible.

Target

Aim for approximately:

1–2 seconds perceived translation latency

but do not claim this target is guaranteed.

Completion

Run regression tests.

Update PROJECT_STATE.md.

Document observed performance and bottlenecks.